WEBVTT

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:31.016
(Ketawa)

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:33.536
Dia cakap, "Minta sikit."
Saya jawab, "T-A-K. Tak."

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:34.776
(Ketawa)

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:36.216
Seronok sangat.

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:39.416
Kali pertama membaca dalam hidup saya.

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:41.480
Perasaan yang saya dapat menakjubkan.

00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:45.840
Kemudian, di usia 22 tahun,
rasa bersemangat

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:48.536
rasa yakin,

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:50.400
saya teringat kata-kata orang tua itu.

00:04:51.760 --> 00:04:55.496
Lalu, saya ambil bahagian perniagaan
dalam akhbar

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.456
Saya nak cari orang kaya kulit putih.

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:59.080
(Ketawa)